WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.120
This has to be one of the best Airbnbs in the Canadian Rockies and it's close to some

00:04.120 --> 00:09.160
of the most scenic national parks in Canada, including Yoho National Park, Lake Louise,

00:09.160 --> 00:11.120
Banff, and the Icefields Parkway.

00:11.120 --> 00:14.920
It's the type of cabin you literally dream of, being right on the edge of this beautiful

00:14.920 --> 00:17.560
river surrounded by the Rocky Mountains.

00:17.560 --> 00:21.840
This secluded cabin offers everything you'd need for the perfect mountain getaway, including

00:21.840 --> 00:26.000
a beautiful kitchen with an espresso machine and a sauna that overlooks the river.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.720
Tell the person you want to bring here and come in cabin and I'll send you a link to

00:29.720 --> 00:32.000
this and more of my favourite Airbnbs.

